  "description": "O que está acontecendo no Golfo Pérsico? Quanto a TSMC faturou em seu junho recorde? Qual startup coreana bateu o recorde de Série A do país?",
  "body_html": "<p>Por: Guilherme Saboia e Vinicius Gushiken</p><h3>Irã ataca seis países do Golfo e fecha Ormuz após nova ofensiva dos EUA</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Ataques.</strong> No domingo, 12 de julho, o Irã lançou mísseis e drones contra <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/ira-ataca-seis-paises-do-golfo-apos-terceira-onda-de-bombardeios-dos-eua\">seis países do Golfo</a>: Bahrein, Catar, Kuwait, Omã, Jordânia e Emirados Árabes Unidos.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ofensiva dos EUA.</strong> Os ataques vieram horas depois da terceira rodada de bombardeios americanos em uma semana; o <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/ira-ataca-seis-paises-do-golfo-apos-terceira-onda-de-bombardeios-dos-eua\">Comando Central dos EUA</a> disse ter atingido mais de 300 alvos militares em três ondas, de vigilância costeira a ativos de mísseis, drones e navais.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ormuz.</strong> A IRGC (Corpo da Guarda Revolucionária Islâmica) declarou o <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/ira-ataca-seis-paises-do-golfo-apos-terceira-onda-de-bombardeios-dos-eua\">Estreito de Ormuz fechado</a> “até novo aviso” e disse ter mirado a base aérea de Al Udeid com mísseis balísticos.</p></li><li><p><strong>Danos.</strong> O Kuwait relatou danos a <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/ira-ataca-seis-paises-do-golfo-apos-terceira-onda-de-bombardeios-dos-eua\">três postos de fronteira</a> no norte e a uma plataforma offshore da Kuwait Oil Company, com um trabalhador ferido; Omã resgatou 23 tripulantes de um navio comercial perto do estreito, com um marinheiro indiano desaparecido.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"390\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1050,&quot;width&quot;:1400,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:107070,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Navio de guerra dispara míssil durante a escalada no Golfo&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Navio de guerra dispara míssil durante a escalada no Golfo\" title=\"Navio de guerra dispara míssil durante a escalada no Golfo\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fyvF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8830ec23-d54a-4973-b7ee-1987419e9844_1400x1050.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Navio de guerra dispara míssil na escalada entre EUA e Irã. Imagem: Reuters</figcaption></figure></div><h3>TSMC bate recorde de receita em junho com alta de 68% puxada pela IA</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Recorde.</strong> A TSMC reportou <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/receita-da-tsmc-cresce-36-impulsionada-por-demanda-de-ia\">receita de junho de NT$442,68 bilhões</a> (cerca de US$13,8 bilhões), seu melhor mês da história, com alta de aproximadamente 68% em relação ao ano anterior.</p></li><li><p><strong>Aceleração.</strong> O salto marca <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/receita-da-tsmc-cresce-36-impulsionada-por-demanda-de-ia\">forte aceleração</a> contra o crescimento anual de cerca de 30% em maio, puxada pela demanda contínua por chips avançados de IA.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ano.</strong> O resultado mantém a empresa no rumo de sua projeção de crescimento de receita acima de 30% em 2026 e de um possível trimestre recorde; a TSMC havia projetado <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/receita-da-tsmc-cresce-36-impulsionada-por-demanda-de-ia\">receita do 2º trimestre</a> entre US$39,0 bilhões e US$40,2 bilhões.</p></li><li><p><strong>Atraso.</strong> O relatório foi adiado para 13 de julho, além do prazo legal habitual do dia 10, depois que o <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/receita-da-tsmc-cresce-36-impulsionada-por-demanda-de-ia\">tufão Bavi</a> desorganizou o cronograma.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"346.6666666666667\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:630,&quot;width&quot;:945,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:112016,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Logotipo da TSMC em um prédio da empresa em Hsinchu, Taiwan&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Logotipo da TSMC em um prédio da empresa em Hsinchu, Taiwan\" title=\"Logotipo da TSMC em um prédio da empresa em Hsinchu, Taiwan\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OgLG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fab82c3ae-efb9-40f1-ac8f-ba10dd871dcd_945x630.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Logotipo da TSMC em Hsinchu, Taiwan. Imagem: Ann Wang/Reuters</figcaption></figure></div><h3>Holiday Robotics capta US$103 milhões na maior Série A da história da Coreia</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Rodada.</strong> A sul-coreana Holiday Robotics fechou uma <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/holiday-robotics-capta-serie-a-recorde-de-155-bi-na-coreia\">Série A de ₩155 bilhões</a> (cerca de US$103 milhões), a maior rodada Série A já captada por uma startup doméstica e a maior de uma especialista coreana em humanoides.</p></li><li><p><strong>Investidores.</strong> Entraram novos <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/holiday-robotics-capta-serie-a-recorde-de-155-bi-na-coreia\">aportes de IMM Investment</a>, KB Investment, Bon Angels, Premier Partners e da americana Goodwater Capital, além dos estatais Korea Development Bank e Industrial Bank of Korea, ao lado dos investidores existentes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Produto.</strong> O robô carro-chefe <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/holiday-robotics-capta-serie-a-recorde-de-155-bi-na-coreia\">FRIDAY</a> é um humanoide sobre rodas de 176 cm e 115 kg, com 64 graus de liberdade, feito para tarefas repetitivas de manufatura e logística ao lado de humanos.</p></li><li><p><strong>Escala.</strong> A empresa, fundada em 2024 por Song Ki-young (criador da Sualab), quer comercializar o FRIDAY no 2º semestre de 2026, começar com <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/holiday-robotics-capta-serie-a-recorde-de-155-bi-na-coreia\">100 unidades por ano</a> e chegar a 1.000 até 2027, mirando uma infraestrutura de mais de 10 mil unidades anuais e um preço de cerca de ₩100 milhões.</p></li></ul><div id=\"youtube2-8tQ2YIdTYO8\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;8tQ2YIdTYO8&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/8tQ2YIdTYO8?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><div><hr></div><blockquote><p><strong>Abaixo, apenas para assinantes:</strong></p><p><strong>Chips.</strong> Uma fabricante asiática vai produzir o próximo processador de IA de uma grande montadora.</p><p><strong>Hardware.</strong> Uma gigante de tecnologia acelera um novo chip voltado à IA local e pula gerações inéditas de sua linha.</p><p><strong>Modelos.</strong> Uma grande empresa de IA recua de mudanças no seu chatbot após ameaças de cancelamento dos usuários.</p><p><strong>Biotech.</strong> Novas parcerias de IA aplicada à descoberta de medicamentos, uma delas com a NVIDIA.</p><p><strong>Saúde.</strong> Uma nova forma de aplicar em casa um tratamento para o Alzheimer inicial.</p></blockquote><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://abacatepay.com\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png\" width=\"4700\" height=\"649\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:649,&quot;width&quot;:4700,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:86036,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;AbacatePay&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://abacatepay.com&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"AbacatePay\" title=\"AbacatePay\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><h4>Fundições e chips</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Samsung.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/samsung-conclui-tape-out-do-chip-ai5-da-tesla-para-2-nm-em-taylor\">Samsung começou os preparativos</a> para fabricar o chip AI5 da Tesla, que concluiu o <em>tape-out</em> (etapa final de projeto antes da produção em massa). O AI5, projeto próprio da Tesla para o Full Self-Driving, os robôs Optimus e data centers de IA, será feito no processo de 2nm da planta de Taylor, Texas, com produção em massa prevista para 2027.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"292.5\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:864,&quot;width&quot;:1536,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:235504,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Fábrica da Samsung em Taylor, Texas&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Fábrica da Samsung em Taylor, Texas\" title=\"Fábrica da Samsung em Taylor, Texas\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!99yL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2458ddd0-76f4-4571-b7cf-f845f6edf2c1_1536x864.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Fábrica da Samsung em Taylor, Texas, onde o chip AI5 da Tesla será produzido. Imagem: Korea Times</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><p><strong>Apple.</strong> A Apple acelera o <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-12/apple-avanca-no-desenvolvimento-dos-chips-m7-e-m8-com-foco-em-ia\">chip M7 voltado à IA local</a>, previsto para o 1º semestre de 2027, e vai pular as versões Pro e Max do M6, algo inédito desde o M1. O M7 base deve trazer cerca de 240 GB/s de largura de banda de memória, alta de aproximadamente 56% contra os 153 GB/s do M5.</p></li><li><p><strong>TSMC.</strong> A TSMC vai erguer a terceira e a quarta <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/tsmc-planeja-construir-duas-novas-fabricas-de-chips-em-taiwan\">fábricas de encapsulamento avançado</a> na Fase II do Parque de Chiayi, ampliando a capacidade de sua tecnologia CoWoS (Chip-on-Wafer-on-Substrate, tecnologia avançada de empacotamento 2.5D/3D). Com as quatro fábricas, o parque deve gerar mais de NT$300 bilhões (cerca de US$9,35 bilhões) anuais e 9.000 empregos.</p></li></ul><h4>Modelos e produtos</h4><ul><li><p><strong>OpenAI.</strong> A OpenAI <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/openai-reverte-mudancas-no-gpt-56-sol-apos-reclamacoes-de-nerfing\">reverteu mudanças no GPT-5.6 Sol</a> após usuários reclamarem de <em>nerfing</em> (degradação deliberada), com alguns ameaçando cancelar a assinatura. A empresa desfez o experimento que alterou os orçamentos de raciocínio, voltará a implementar o limite de contexto de 372 mil tokens e diz repassar a economia de inferência a todas as assinaturas, o que deve gerar cerca de 10% mais uso.</p></li></ul><h4>Bio-IA e saúde</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Israel.</strong> A Israel Innovation Authority anunciou cerca de <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/israel-cria-consorcio-de-bio-ia-de-nis-70-mi-com-nvidia-e-teva\">NIS 70 milhões</a> (US$ 23 milhões) para a Israel BioToken Factory Initiative, consórcio de IA aplicada à biologia e à descoberta de fármacos com NVIDIA, Teva, Sheba Medical Center e institutos como o Weizmann e o Technion.</p></li><li><p><strong>Insilico Medicine.</strong> A biotech <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/insilico-e-cms-firmam-acordo-de-farmacos-por-ia-de-ate-12-bi-de-rmb\">Insilico Medicine fechou colaboração</a> com a China Medical System para descoberta por IA de fármacos que atuam no sistema nervoso central, podendo receber até cerca de 1,2 bilhão de RMB em pagamentos por marcos mais royalties.</p></li><li><p><strong>Leqembi.</strong> Eisai e Biogen apresentaram dados indicando que o <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/injecao-caseira-de-leqembi-iguala-versao-intravenosa-no-alzheimer-inicial\">autoinjetor subcutâneo de Leqembi</a> (lecanemabe) iguala a infusão intravenosa no Alzheimer inicial, com dose de 500 mg semanal em casa no lugar das infusões.</p></li></ul><h4>Mercados</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Petróleo e Ásia.</strong> O Brent subiu mais de 4%, a <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/tensoes-entre-eua-e-ira-derrubam-mercados-e-elevam-preco-do-petroleo\">US$78,82 por barril</a>, maior valor desde 22 de junho, enquanto o Kospi despencou 9% e o Nikkei caiu quase 2% com a situação no Golfo Pérsico.</p></li></ul><h4>Mundo</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Ucrânia.</strong> Mais de 25 líderes se reuniram em Paris na “<a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/mais-de-25-lideres-se-reunem-em-paris-por-cupula-sobre-a-ucrania\">Coalizão dos Dispostos</a>”, já expandida para 37 países, para tratar do apoio à Ucrânia, com foco em defesa aérea e na produção licenciada de mísseis Patriot em território ucraniano. O encontro segue a cúpula da OTAN em Ancara, que comprometeu 70 bilhões de euros em ajuda militar a Kiev em 2026.</p></li></ul><div><hr></div><div class=\"callout-block\" data-callout=\"true\"><h4>Leia também</h4><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/morre-o-senador-americano-lindsey-graham-aos-71-anos\">Lindsey Graham, senador dos EUA e aliado de Trump, morre aos 71 anos por dissecção da aorta</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-12/morre-aos-74-anos-sheikh-hamad-bin-khalifa-ex-emir-do-catar\">Sheikh Hamad bin Khalifa Al Thani, artífice do Catar moderno, morre aos 74 anos</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-12/incendio-florestal-na-espanha-deixa-13-mortos-e-e-estabilizado\">Incêndio florestal em Almería, na Espanha, mata 13 durante onda de calor</a></p></li></ul></div><div><hr></div><h3><strong>Recomendação de hoje:</strong></h3><p><strong>The $44 Billion Company Building Self-Driving Money | Eric Glyman, Ramp:</strong> Este episódio do podcast de David Senra traz uma entrevista com Eric Glyman, cofundador e co-CEO da Ramp. A Ramp é uma plataforma de infraestrutura financeira avaliada em US$ 44 bilhões, que automatiza pagamentos, despesas e contabilidade para mais de 70.000 empresas. O vídeo explora a filosofia de gestão de Glyman, o uso de inteligência artificial para otimizar processos financeiros e a visão de que a Ramp não vende apenas movimentação de dinheiro, mas sim tempo e eficiência.:</p><div id=\"youtube2-lbGX3cbvMI4\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;lbGX3cbvMI4&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:&quot;241s&quot;,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/lbGX3cbvMI4?start=241s&amp;rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div>",
